# --- Source maps -----------------------------------------------------------
# ~3.5MB of the 4.5MB dist/ folder, and they reference controls/src/ sources
# that are not shipped, so they are unusable in production.
*.map

# --- Unreferenced webfonts -------------------------------------------------
# Font Awesome 4 legacy set, superseded by the fa-brands/fa-regular/fa-solid
# v5 files. No CSS, JS or PHP in this plugin references it. ~936KB.
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.eot
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.svg
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.ttf
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.woff
assets/fonts/fontawesome-webfont.woff2
assets/fonts/FontAwesome.otf
# Icon-picker webfont: referenced nowhere in the shipped code.
assets/fonts/fontIconPicker.svg
assets/fonts/fontIconPicker.ttf
assets/fonts/fontIconPicker.woff

# --- Dead webfont formats --------------------------------------------------
# .eot is Internet Explorer only (IE11 EOL June 2022; WordPress dropped IE11
# in 5.8). SVG fonts were removed from Chrome in 2014 and never shipped in
# Firefox or Edge. Nothing in this plugin's declared WP 6.0+ support window
# requests either format -- the @font-face src chain falls through to
# woff2 -> woff -> ttf, which covers every supported browser. ~2.15MB.
assets/fonts/fa-brands-400.eot
assets/fonts/fa-brands-400.svg
assets/fonts/fa-regular-400.eot
assets/fonts/fa-regular-400.svg
assets/fonts/fa-solid-900.eot
assets/fonts/fa-solid-900.svg

# --- Docs / dev artifacts --------------------------------------------------
README.md
compatibility-report.md

# --- Archives & dumps ------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
**/*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.sql
*.tgz
*.log
